      "name": "Remember, You're Under Oath",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "concentrate",
        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The judge reminds a creature of the oath they swore to the court. The judge makes an intimidation|defense:will check against the target's Will DC. On a success, the target takes a –2 status penalty to Deception checks to Lie for 10 minutes (or a –4 status penalty on a critical success). Regardless of the result, the target is temporarily immune to this ability for 24 hours.</p>\n<p>Effect: Remember, You're Under Oath</p>",
